title: A Way Out of Prison
subtitle: Comrades plan to free a party leader.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year <= 1920 and time >= 4 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and e19_rescue_line = 0 and (comrades_in_prison >= 2 or (comrades_in_prison >= 1 and comrade_radek != 2))
max-visits: 1
priority: 1
on-arrival: {!
var c = null;
for (var i = 0; i < Q.comrades.length; i++) {
    var x = Q.comrades[i];
    if (x.status == 'prison' && x.faction != 'ecci' && x.id != 'levine') { c = x; break; }
}
Q.e19_rescue_id = c ? c.id : 0;
Q.e19_rescue_name = c ? c.name : 'one of our district secretaries';
Q.e19_rescue_ok = 0;
!}

= A Way Out of Prison

**[+ e19_rescue_name +]** has been held for weeks under the state of siege, with no date for a trial. Every Thursday the prisoner is taken to the court building in Moabit in a closed van with two policemen. Two of the warders are union men, and one owes money.

The young comrades want to stop the van. The prisoner has sent out a note: "Do nothing stupid on my account."

- @van: Stop the van in the street.
- @warders: Pay the warders, and get the prisoner across the border.
- @wait: Send parcels, and nothing else.

@van
subtitle: A little better than even odds. If it goes wrong, the police may shoot.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_rescue_line = 1;
var r = Math.random();
if (r < 0.55) {
    Q.e19_rescue_ok = 1;
    if (Q.e19_rescue_id) { RG.free(Q.e19_rescue_id, {news: Q.e19_rescue_name + ' freed from a police van in Berlin', priority: 3}); }
} else if (r < 0.7 && Q.e19_rescue_id) {
    Q.e19_rescue_ok = 2;
    RG.kill(Q.e19_rescue_id, {news: Q.e19_rescue_name + ' shot "while trying to escape"', priority: 3});
}
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.district('berlin', {repression: 6});
!}

[? if e19_rescue_ok = 1 : A coal cart blocks a corner in Moabit. Two men with pistols open the van, and [+ e19_rescue_name +] disappears into the crowd. ?][? if e19_rescue_ok = 0 : The police have been warned. The van takes another road, and three of our young comrades are arrested at the corner with revolvers in their pockets. ?][? if e19_rescue_ok = 2 : The police were waiting. [+ e19_rescue_name +] is shot in the back. The official report says the prisoner was trying to escape, which for once is true. ?]

@warders
subtitle: [? if e19_apparatus = 1 : The apparatus has its own people in Moabit. It costs nothing. ?][? if e19_apparatus = 0 : Costs 2 funds. ?] The prisoner will be abroad for a while.
choose-if: e19_apparatus = 1 or resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We have no money to pay anyone.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_rescue_line = 2;
if (!Q.e19_apparatus) { Q.resources -= 2; }
if (Q.e19_rescue_id) { RG.exile(Q.e19_rescue_id, {news: Q.e19_rescue_name + ' escapes from prison and flees abroad', priority: 2}); }
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

A cell door is left unlocked on a Sunday night. [+ e19_rescue_name +] walks out in a warder's coat and is in Vienna by Wednesday.

@wait
subtitle: The district will say the Zentrale does not look after its own.
on-arrival: e19_rescue_line = 4; unity -= 2; offensive_satisfaction -= 4
